[gd_scene load_steps=8 format=3 uid="uid://dealprod0sfgd"]

; BTN-1 (2026-09-19) — ONE OF THE RACK'S THREE NEAR-MISSES: the produce item.
;
; PLACEHOLDER. Read DealBox.tscn's header for the contract SHELF-1 inherits.
;
; THE ONLY ONE OF THE THREE THAT IS A BALL, and that is not cosmetic: PropManager.AuthoredKindOf
; reads the `CollisionShape3D`'s type to decide PropKind, so this one adopts as Ball and the other
; two as Crate. Nothing about the round cares, but the carry POSE does, and a suite reading prop
; kinds off the wire will see the difference.
;
; DAMPING, copied from Sphere.tscn and for its reason: a sphere with the engine defaults rolls
; across a flat floor for a very long time. A hidden object that will not stay where the hider put
; it is a hide the seeker did not have to work for — and, one lane over, a rest audit that never
; latches.

